<ResearchLayout title="AI Platform｜J 的世界 Research" page="P3">
<div class="editorial-page">
  <div class="page-kicker">RESEARCH · VOL.01 · P3</div>
  <div class="page-meta"><span>SIGNAL <b>AI Platform</b></span><span>EVIDENCE <b>FACTS FIRST</b></span><span>FOCUS <b>AI PLATFORM EVOLUTION</b></span></div>
  <h1 class="page-title">AI Platform Evolution</h1>
  <p class="page-subtitle">四個訊號如何共同打造下一代 AI 平台</p>
  <div class="editorial-rule"></div>
  <div class="lead-grid">
    <div class="lead-visual"><div class="visual-label">FOUR SIGNALS</div><div class="visual-center"><div class="core"><b>AI<br/>PLATFORM</b></div><small>EVOLUTION</small></div><div class="visual-icon-grid four"><div class="vicon"><div class="symbol">01</div><b>COMPUTE</b><small>DENSITY</small></div><div class="vicon"><div class="symbol">02</div><b>PACKAGING</b><small>3DFABRIC</small></div><div class="vicon"><div class="symbol">03</div><b>OPTICAL</b><small>BANDWIDTH</small></div><div class="vicon"><div class="symbol">04</div><b>MATERIALS</b><small>INFRASTRUCTURE</small></div></div></div><aside class="lead-note"><span class="tag">AI PLATFORM</span><h2>四個訊號，不是四則孤立消息。</h2><p>它們共同描述一個正在形成的系統：運算密度提高、封裝整合加深、光互連成為關鍵方向，材料與基礎設施同步升級。</p></aside>
  </div>
  <div class="j-insight"><span class="insight-label">J 的解讀 · PUT THE FOUR SIGNALS TOGETHER</span><h3>真正重要的不是四個名詞，而是它們正在互相牽動。</h3><p>算力提高，封裝密度就跟著提高；封裝與互連變快，功耗與散熱壓力也會上升；當系統瓶頸往外移，材料與基礎設施的重要性自然增加。這就是「AI Platform Evolution」要看的整體變化。</p><small>Research framing：四個訊號共同描述下一代 AI 平台的系統化演進。</small></div>
  <section class="section"><div class="section-head"><div><div class="eyebrow">01–04</div><h2>四個訊號</h2></div></div><div class="editorial-grid two"><article class="editorial-card"><div class="num">01</div><h3>Compute Scaling</h3><p>先進製程持續推進，AI/HPC 對運算密度與能源效率的需求同步提高。</p><div class="bottom-line">COMPUTE · DENSITY · EFFICIENCY</div></article><article class="editorial-card"><div class="num">02</div><h3>Advanced Packaging</h3><p>CoWoS、SoIC、SoW 等 3DFabric 技術，將晶片、記憶體與系統整合推向更高密度。</p><div class="bottom-line">INTEGRATION · 3DFABRIC</div></article><article class="editorial-card"><div class="num">03</div><h3>Optical Interconnect</h3><p>當電互連的頻寬、距離與功耗成為限制，光互連成為下一階段 AI 系統的重要研究方向。</p><div class="bottom-line">OPTICAL · BANDWIDTH · POWER</div></article><article class="editorial-card"><div class="num">04</div><h3>Materials & Infrastructure</h3><p>製程、封裝與互連升級，同時推動材料、設備、散熱與電力需求。</p><div class="bottom-line">MATERIALS · THERMAL · POWER</div></article></div></section><section class="section"><div class="section-head"><div><div class="eyebrow">BOTTOM LINE</div><h2>四個訊號最後指向哪裡？</h2></div></div><div class="quote">從單一晶片最佳化，走向整個 <strong>AI Platform</strong> 的共同最佳化。</div></section>
  
</div>
</ResearchLayout>
